	(text "Vout = 0.596 * (RV1+R5+R4) / (RV1+R5)\nVout_min = 0.596 * (10+4.7+100) / (10+4.7) = 4.65V\nVout_max = 0.596 * (0+4.7+100) / (0+4.7) = 13.28V\nDefault: Q1 on holds FB low, Vout ~ VIN (~15 V bypass)\nOvercurrent: Q1 off, U6 regulates at the RV1 setpoint"
