	(text "INA381A1 (amplifier + comparator):\ntrips when I > V(CMPREF) / 1 V/A\n(20 V/V x 50 mOhm shunt)\nRESET to GND: transparent mode\nALERT: open-drain, active low\n  normal: high, Q1 on, U6 FB held low,\n    Vout ~ VIN (~15 V)\n  overcurrent: low, Q1 off,\n    U6 regulates at the RV1 setpoint\nV_HYS = 4 uA x (12.5k + R10)\n  = 0.38 V, i.e. ~0.4 A (R10 82k)\nThreshold (RV2): R9 82k / RV2 50k / R23 27k\n  CMPREF 0.56..1.60 V, i.e. 0.56..1.60 A\n  (keep CMPREF > V_HYS or ALERT never releases)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1a8df553-209a-4959-a2a9-82503423b508")
	)
